According to a report by Intel Market Research, Global Digital Banking Platform market size was valued at USD 14.2 billion in 2025. The market is forecasted to grow from USD 15.0 billion in 2026 to USD 31.5 billion by 2034, exhibiting a CAGR of 8.6 % during the forecast period.
